+   Ensure `voxel_size` is a 1D tensor of 3 elements on the target device. If `grid_size` is not provided, compute it from `aabb` and `voxel_size`:
+   $$ N_i = \text{round}\left(\frac{max_i - min_i}{s_i}\right) $$
