--   **Memory Complexity**: Not given in the sources. [G]
--   **Strengths**: Produces dense, aligned volumetric attributes suitable for volume rendering pipelines [S1, unofficial].
--   **Limitations**: Requires watertight meshes for optimal results in proximity-based variants [S2, unofficial].
